# f1 = mix, f2 = stir, f3 = mixAll, f4 = stirAll, f5 = mixCounts
# A leaf is Link's word: no loop, at most a hundred operations, it calls leaves alone. Both leaves here weigh more than the twelve that a leaf may weigh to be copied for its size.
# A call in a loop that hands a leaf what the turn has read out of a view pays for the number at the call and behind it: the leaf is copied as far as the window of a written call in loops reaches.
